{
  "title": "Ziyarat on Thursday",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Imam Hasan al-Askari (a.s.)\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِیَّ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WALIYYAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O saint of Allah!\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ اللهِ وَ خَالِصَتَهٗ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAL LAAHE WA KHAALESATAHU \nPeace be upon you, O argument of Allah and His choicest!\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اِمَامَ الْمُوْمِنِيْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA EMAAMAL MOMENEENA \nPeace be upon you, O leader of the faithful believers,\nوَ وَارِثَ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ \nWA WAARESAL MURSALEENA \ninheritor of the messengers,\nوَ حُجَّةَ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ \nWA HUJJATA RABBIL A’ALAMEENA \nand argument of the Lord of the Worlds!\nصَلَّی اللهُ عَلَيْكَ وَ عَلٰی اٰلِ بَيْتِكَ الطَّيِّبِيْنَ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ \nSALLAL LAAHO A’LAYKA WA A’LAA AALE BAYTEKAT TAYYEBEENAT TAAHEREENA \nMay Allah send peace upon you and upon your Household, the pure and immaculate!\nيَا مَوْلَایَ يَا اَبَا مُحَمَّدٍۨ الْحَسَنَ بْنَ عَلِیٍّ \nYAA MAWLAAYA YAA ABAA MOHAMMADENIL HASANABNA A’LIYYIN\nO Master, O Abu Mohammad, al-Hasan, the son of Ali! \nاَنَا مَوْلًی لَكَ وَلِآلِ بَيْتِكَ \nANAA MAWLAN LAKA WA LE AALE BAYTEKA \nI am a servant of you and of your Household\nوَ هٰذَا يَوْمُكَ وَ هُوَ يَوْمُ الْخَمِيْسِ \nWA HAAZAA YAWMOKA WA HOWA YAWMUL KHAMEESE \nand today is your day, which is Thursday,\nوَ اَنَا ضَيْفُكَ فِيْهِ  وَ مُسْتَجِيْرٌ بِكَ فِيْهِ \nWA ANAA ZAYFOKA FEEHE WA MUSTAJEERUN BEKA FEEHE \nand on this day, I am your guest and in your vicinity;\nفَاَحْسِنْ ضِيَافَتِیْ وَ اِجَارَتِیْ \nFA-AHSIN ZEYAAFATEE WA EJAARATEE \nso, receive me hospitably as your guest and neighbour,\nبِحَقِّ اٰلِ بَيْتِكَ الطَّيِّبِيْنَ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ.\nBE-HAQQE AALE BAYTEKAT TAYYEBEENAT TAAHEREENA.\n[I ask you] in the name of your Household, the pure and immaculate."
}
